# Text files are stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform (eol=lf): the build
# embeds some of them (crates/layouts/embedded, the highlight styles, livereload.min.js, ...) and
# the release archives ship others (README.md, LICENSE, ...), so a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true must not give them CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# SVG files should not be modified
*.svg -text

# Test fixtures and golden/test data must be stored byte-exact
# (some contain CRLF that text=auto would rewrite).
testdata/** -text
tools/rust-port/testdata/** -text
